{
  "sn11.1:0.1": "Linked Discourses 11.1 ",
  "sn11.1:0.2": "Chapter One ",
  "sn11.1:0.3": "With Suvīra ",
  "sn11.1:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "sn11.1:1.2": "At one time the Buddha was staying near Sāvatthī in Jeta’s Grove, Anāthapiṇḍika’s monastery. ",
  "sn11.1:1.3": "There the Buddha addressed the mendicants, ",
  "sn11.1:1.4": "“Mendicants!” ",
  "sn11.1:1.5": "“Venerable sir,” they replied. ",
  "sn11.1:1.6": "The Buddha said this: ",
  "sn11.1:2.1": "“Once upon a time, mendicants, the titans marched against the gods. ",
  "sn11.1:2.2": "Then Sakka, lord of gods, addressed the godling Suvīra, ",
  "sn11.1:2.3": "‘Dear Suvīra, the titans march against the gods! ",
  "sn11.1:2.4": "Go, and march against the titans!’ ",
  "sn11.1:2.5": "‘Yes, lord,’ replied Suvīra. But he fell into negligence. ",
  "sn11.1:2.6": "For a second time Sakka addressed Suvīra, ",
  "sn11.1:2.7": "‘Dear Suvīra, the titans march against the gods! ",
  "sn11.1:2.8": "Go, and march against the titans!’ ",
  "sn11.1:2.9": "‘Yes, lord,’ replied Suvīra. But for a second time he fell into negligence. ",
  "sn11.1:2.10": "For a third time Sakka addressed Suvīra, ",
  "sn11.1:2.11": "‘Dear Suvīra, the titans march against the gods! ",
  "sn11.1:2.12": "Go, and march against the titans!’ ",
  "sn11.1:2.13": "‘Yes, lord,’ replied Suvīra. But for a third time he fell into negligence. ",
  "sn11.1:2.14": "Then Sakka addressed the godling Suvīra in verse: ",
  "sn11.1:3.1": "‘Suvīra,